    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2000780/extras/637be05d798b76c7cd8dce159ce39af1.avif?t=1753279396\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">It All Started with a Dream</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The Burrow League is the most popular sport in R&amp;D Mine, and all 14-year-old Penny wants is to claim the Burrow League Champion title from her big sister Coppra. To do so, Penny must leave home, explore R&amp;D Mine, defeat the four Burrow League Captains, and finally face her sister in the ultimate battle! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2000780/extras/83eb428c4d75a1478b73dd1e2b69c556.poster.avif?t=1753279396\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2000780/extras/83eb428c4d75a1478b73dd1e2b69c556.webm?t=1753279396\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2000780/extras/83eb428c4d75a1478b73dd1e2b69c556.mp4?t=1753279396\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Mole Maiden is a brand-new 2D Action Adventure about a Mole Girl who leaves home to become a champion fighter! Explore a vast interconnected world chalk full of tricky platforming challenges, diverse characters, quirky boss fights, and a whole bunch of juicy secrets; as you work towards your ultimate goal to become the very best! <br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2000780/extras/c6ea4ba593c3d8689ed2ff443131d16d.poster.avif?t=1753279396\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2000780/extras/c6ea4ba593c3d8689ed2ff443131d16d.webm?t=1753279396\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2000780/extras/c6ea4ba593c3d8689ed2ff443131d16d.mp4?t=1753279396\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Game Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Variety is our Spice!</strong> Mole Maiden features a huge cast of characters from all different walks of life! Sumo wrestlers, psychotic scientists, amputee martial artists; the world of R&amp;D mines is a melting pop of colorful showstoppers who will capture your hearts and imaginations! </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Classic <strong>2D side-scrolling action!</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Perfectly tuned 2D controls.</strong> Switch between a traditional side-scroller and a 360-degree drilling game! </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Charmingly paced!</strong> Adventure through a hand-crafted world designed to be the ultimate playground! Use every tool in your ever-expanding arsenal to jump, dash, parry, and launch your way through any challenge. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Designed to be Repeated!</strong> Get creative and discover baked-in sequence breaks, shortcuts, and quick kills that make every adventure through R&amp;D Mine unique! </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>From Sea to Shining Sea!</strong> Each area of R&amp;D Mine is different from the one before. Every new place you go in Mole Maiden comes with its own unique gimmicks, enemies, and people. Journey through a new kind of underground designed be as weird and unpredictable as the people who live in it! </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Ooo, Right in the Feels!</strong> Mole Maiden tells the universal story of following your dreams! Inspired by the creator's hardship to become a game developer, Mole Maiden is a personal tale that never pulls its punches. You will laugh, cry, and cheer from start to finish!</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2000780/extras/637be05d798b76c7cd8dce159ce39af1.avif?t=1753279396\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">It All Started with a Dream</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The Burrow League is the most popular sport in R&amp;D Mine, and all 14-year-old Penny wants is to claim the Burrow League Champion title from her big sister Coppra. To do so, Penny must leave home, explore R&amp;D Mine, defeat the four Burrow League Captains, and finally face her sister in the ultimate battle! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2000780/extras/83eb428c4d75a1478b73dd1e2b69c556.poster.avif?t=1753279396\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2000780/extras/83eb428c4d75a1478b73dd1e2b69c556.webm?t=1753279396\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2000780/extras/83eb428c4d75a1478b73dd1e2b69c556.mp4?t=1753279396\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Mole Maiden is a brand-new 2D Action Adventure about a Mole Girl who leaves home to become a champion fighter! Explore a vast interconnected world chalk full of tricky platforming challenges, diverse characters, quirky boss fights, and a whole bunch of juicy secrets; as you work towards your ultimate goal to become the very best! <br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2000780/extras/c6ea4ba593c3d8689ed2ff443131d16d.poster.avif?t=1753279396\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2000780/extras/c6ea4ba593c3d8689ed2ff443131d16d.webm?t=1753279396\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2000780/extras/c6ea4ba593c3d8689ed2ff443131d16d.mp4?t=1753279396\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Game Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Variety is our Spice!</strong> Mole Maiden features a huge cast of characters from all different walks of life! Sumo wrestlers, psychotic scientists, amputee martial artists; the world of R&amp;D mines is a melting pop of colorful showstoppers who will capture your hearts and imaginations! </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Classic <strong>2D side-scrolling action!</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Perfectly tuned 2D controls.</strong> Switch between a traditional side-scroller and a 360-degree drilling game! </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Charmingly paced!</strong> Adventure through a hand-crafted world designed to be the ultimate playground! Use every tool in your ever-expanding arsenal to jump, dash, parry, and launch your way through any challenge. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Designed to be Repeated!</strong> Get creative and discover baked-in sequence breaks, shortcuts, and quick kills that make every adventure through R&amp;D Mine unique! </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>From Sea to Shining Sea!</strong> Each area of R&amp;D Mine is different from the one before. Every new place you go in Mole Maiden comes with its own unique gimmicks, enemies, and people. Journey through a new kind of underground designed be as weird and unpredictable as the people who live in it! </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Ooo, Right in the Feels!</strong> Mole Maiden tells the universal story of following your dreams! Inspired by the creator's hardship to become a game developer, Mole Maiden is a personal tale that never pulls its punches. You will laugh, cry, and cheer from start to finish!</p></li></ul>",
